OL,3,GNEWSABattle wants refund for cancelled
OL,4,Afireworks display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Battle of Flowers has asked Ports
OL,7,Fof Jersey to pay some of the #8,000 it
OL,8,Fsaid it lost after its fireworks finale
OL,9,Fdisplay was cancelled.
OL,11,FOrganisers originally planned to go
OL,12,Fahead with a fireworks display for the
OL,13,FSaturday evening show, despite
OL,14,Fconcerns, but they were cancelled as
OL,15,Fthe association said it was "unable to
OL,16,Freach a position required to secure the
OL,17,Fnecessary licence".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
