OL,3,GNEWSABattle wants refund for cancelled
OL,4,Afireworks display
OL,5,
OL,6,FPorts of Jersey said the fireworks show
OL,7,Fcould not go ahead because of the fire
OL,8,Frisk and "emergency response concerns"
OL,9,Fcaused by the dry summer Jersey had
OL,10,Fbeen experiencing.
OL,12,FIt said it did not take the decision
OL,13,Flightly and advice from the fire
OL,14,Fservice contributed to the decision to
OL,15,Fnot issue a display permit.
